"Michael Farrell \u003cmicolous+git@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2089923 - Propagate PIN callback for `about:webauthn` management commands  a=pascalc DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340260\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D341987\n", "files": ["dom/webauthn/WebAuthnService.cpp"], "git_node": "05b2056785fbd3ef96da8dd1d75a42515dcb4516", "git_parents": ["95a09e9aa18db88dea2897c4efcb4856cf26b724"], "node": "10cf4166152ceb9693fef56d2139ba20095a1978", "parents": ["088d0286c03c6bd601900fe67a009bfd1bd0d0bf"], "tags": []}], "date": 1794562008, "git_changesets": ["05b2056785fbd3ef96da8dd1d75a42515dcb4516"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1246": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jonathan Kew \u003cjkew@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2080094 - On macOS, disable leak-checking for the FontData struct.  a=pascalc DONTBUILD\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D341588\n", "files": ["gfx/thebes/FontData.h"], "git_node": "c7ffde2b28f69f4c774095050a1afadae66fc42f", "git_parents": ["05b2056785fbd3ef96da8dd1d75a42515dcb4516"], "node": "411e7dde0a23f7ac6663ebac4019326d1d1c138f", "parents": ["10cf4166152ceb9693fef56d2139ba20095a1978"], "tags": []}], "date": 1794562251, "git_changesets": ["c7ffde2b28f69f4c774095050a1afadae66fc42f"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1247": {"changesets": [{"author": "Daniel Holbert \u003cdholbert@cs.stanford.edu\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2088486 - Make Selection::Repaint do its iteration over a copy of the ranges instead of the main array.  a=pascalc DONTBUILD\n\nOur call to SelectFrames can mutate mStyledRanges, including changing its\nlength. So, to avoid walking off the end of the array and aborting, it's safer\nto iterate over a copy of the array, just as we do in\nSelection::DeleteFromDocument().\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D341481\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D341637\n", "files": ["dom/base/Selection.cpp", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-highlight-api/crashtests/firefox-bug-2088486.html"], "git_node": "5cc175936c656d0c53906dff03d82611e04ee20f", "git_parents": ["c7ffde2b28f69f4c774095050a1afadae66fc42f"], "node": "d4c5ba08e402903d0b6c5148778a914d19b75ab2", "parents": ["411e7dde0a23f7ac6663ebac4019326d1d1c138f"], "tags": []}], "date": 1794562274, "git_changesets": ["5cc175936c656d0c53906dff03d82611e04ee20f"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1248": {"changesets": [{"author": "Sam Johnson \u003csam@scj.me\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087261 - Apply paragraph styles to attributed strings in native menus.  a=pascalc DONTBUILD\n\nWhen a `NSMenuItem` has an `attributedTitle`, it defaults to an unstyled appearance, which results in some undesired effects such as clipping and incorrectly aligned RTL titles. Apply our own paragraph styles to restore the expected formatting.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D341217\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D341922\n", "files": ["widget/cocoa/nsMenuUtilsX.mm"], "git_node": "30ad382194a50f2c6ec2001d4e90e796006af2ce", "git_parents": ["5cc175936c656d0c53906dff03d82611e04ee20f"], "node": "b2ae275a5f77f16b5cd27095fc118ac8d9ade72e", "parents": ["d4c5ba08e402903d0b6c5148778a914d19b75ab2"], "tags": []}], "date": 1794562299, "git_changesets": ["30ad382194a50f2c6ec2001d4e90e796006af2ce"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1249": {"changesets": [{"author": "Hiroyuki Ikezoe \u003chikezoe.birchill@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2089582 - Bail out early from Document::EditingStateChanged for non-HTML/XHTML documents.  a=pascalc DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D341212\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D341940\n", "files": ["dom/base/Document.cpp"], "git_node": "3706d1774208ef4a14cba8d265a31ba7e014ef88", "git_parents": ["30ad382194a50f2c6ec2001d4e90e796006af2ce"], "node": "9f6375762096f188bac74289751fd679e7a092ff", "parents": ["b2ae275a5f77f16b5cd27095fc118ac8d9ade72e"], "tags": []}], "date": 1794562392, "git_changesets": ["3706d1774208ef4a14cba8d265a31ba7e014ef88"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1250": {"changesets": [{"author": "Nicolas Silva \u003cnsilva@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074205 - Avoid building WR bridges twice.  a=pascalc DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333195\n\n(cherry picked from commit ae803b44587ee5edcad2302104ffcd6b2f31cda2)\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D342163\n", "files": ["gfx/layers/ipc/CompositorBridgeParent.cpp", "gfx/layers/ipc/ContentCompositorBridgeParent.cpp"], "git_node": "8c8ef08e3f9ee72da7224452ea82284e67219d2e", "git_parents": ["3706d1774208ef4a14cba8d265a31ba7e014ef88"], "node": "c39106d8ab13e5005efb8de5bd071fc9ea673da6", "parents": ["9f6375762096f188bac74289751fd679e7a092ff"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nicolas Silva \u003cnsilva@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074205 - Check that the pipeline is not in use when creating a WebRenderBridgeParent.  a=pascalc DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333197\n\n(cherry picked from commit 163245b932951df3104fa8fc9b723905fe01a239)\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D342164\n", "files": ["gfx/layers/ipc/ContentCompositorBridgeParent.cpp", "gfx/layers/wr/AsyncImagePipelineManager.h"], "git_node": "228c6c2f65b0895ed9ebdaebe180e12fb144f6b6", "git_parents": ["8c8ef08e3f9ee72da7224452ea82284e67219d2e"], "node": "8160112ad5a5d769eefa09558b88f838e5c66c92", "parents": ["c39106d8ab13e5005efb8de5bd071fc9ea673da6"], "tags": []}], "date": 1794562415, "git_changesets": ["8c8ef08e3f9ee72da7224452ea82284e67219d2e", "228c6c2f65b0895ed9ebdaebe180e12fb144f6b6"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1251": {"changesets": [{"author": "Alex Franchuk \u003cafranchuk@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073888 - Rework the Glean crash ping submission to shutdown gracefully  a=pascalc DONTBUILD\n\nThis changes the logic to return whether the ping was submitted to the\ncrashreporter client successfully, and to subsequently mark it as\nsubmitted if so. Previously, we always marked it as submitted if it made\nit to the `sendGleanPing` \"queue\" of promises, but this is unnecessary\nand prone to error (especially when it comes to shutdown).\n\nThe shutdown blocker message is kept the same as the previous one so\nthat the crash signature remains the same (to facilitate analyzing the\neffect of this patch). It wouldn't be hard to add the expected new\nsignature to the bug, but the blocker message is still broadly accurate\nto what's being done.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338434\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D342180\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/crashes/CrashManager.in.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "1d5b6da8dea3837b778df8c73608d282310130b3", "git_parents": ["228c6c2f65b0895ed9ebdaebe180e12fb144f6b6"], "node": "8786855e9e93ede52535ec8707404ec9a4034b24", "parents": ["8160112ad5a5d769eefa09558b88f838e5c66c92"], "tags": []}], "date": 1794562442, "git_changesets": ["1d5b6da8dea3837b778df8c73608d282310130b3"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1252": {"changesets": [{"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2089704.  a=pascalc DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340297\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340610\n", "files": ["dom/webidl/StyleSheet.webidl", "layout/style/StyleSheet.h"], "git_node": "f64efde4863b85c2790d163b7772ae7941efb661", "git_parents": ["1d5b6da8dea3837b778df8c73608d282310130b3"], "node": "6f579ce1a7aeb6cd6fe130186f1158d4586f8627", "parents"